{"id":"n66576-1-11","stage":2,"title":"예정 · 预定","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66576-1-11-1","ko":"친구는 잘 만나고 왔어?","zh":"你和朋友见面还顺利吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"친구는","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구는","audio":"/audio/3cc026d51b6dcef53c27.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"만나고","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만나고","audio":"/audio/dea8ba830b515603a2d5.mp3"}},{"text":"왔어?","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔어","audio":"/audio/1c7a0c0d37b0eadd46f3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"见面，相逢","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"其中一人来或去，二人因而相见。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"到达想去的地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/482863410ad2dae75e9f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66576-1-11-2","ko":"응. 갑자기 연락이 와서 예정에 없던 외출이었지만 오랜만에 즐거웠어.","zh":"嗯。突然接到联系，虽然这次出门不在计划内，但难得玩得这么开心。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"연락이","meaning":"联络，联系","explanation":"연락：联络，联系；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"연락","audio":"/audio/b1c3b94a6a87c1f5d675.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14013","senseId":"1","lemma":"연락","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연락이","audio":"/audio/5939c757dc359a5f6c8a.mp3"}},{"text":"와서","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와서","audio":"/audio/fff1948ffcab0f48d739.mp3"}},{"text":"예정에","meaning":"预定","explanation":"예정：预定；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"예정","audio":"/audio/8688e9ff7c84e0e44571.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66576","senseId":"1","lemma":"예정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예정에","audio":"/audio/a77b39e84c19a19b5b97.mp3"}},{"text":"없던","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"14","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없던","audio":"/audio/c030da5f9801d7416e95.mp3"}},{"text":"외출이었지만","meaning":"外出，出行，出门","explanation":"외출：外出，出行，出门；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"외출","audio":"/audio/b39546a26046f3d2c5d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67857","senseId":"1","lemma":"외출","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"외출이었지만","audio":"/audio/f680c18aa1ab0eb7ba06.mp3"}},{"text":"오랜만에","meaning":"好久，久违","explanation":"오랜만：好久，久违；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"오랜만","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68090","senseId":"1","lemma":"오랜만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오랜만에","audio":"/audio/cf175d7879a1bf3c7749.mp3"}},{"text":"즐거웠어.","meaning":"愉快，欢乐，欢快","explanation":"즐겁다：愉快，欢乐，欢快；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"즐겁다","audio":"/audio/71ab7f4d89daedabda61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62101","senseId":"1","lemma":"즐겁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"즐거웠어","audio":"/audio/5143c6fb7e3df79fffaf.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"b1c3b94a6a87c1f5","term":"연락","zh":"联络，联系","audio":"/audio/b1c3b94a6a87c1f5d675.mp3","entryId":"14013","definition":"传达告知某个事实。","pronunciation":["열락"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"8688e9ff7c84e0e4","term":"예정","zh":"预定","audio":"/audio/8688e9ff7c84e0e44571.mp3","entryId":"66576","definition":"提前定下或预想将来的事情。","pronunciation":["예ː정"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不成立理由或可能性。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"b39546a26046f3d2","term":"외출","zh":"外出，出行，出门","audio":"/audio/b39546a26046f3d2c5d6.mp3","entryId":"67857","definition":"有事要干从家里或公司等地出去。","pronunciation":["외ː출","웨ː출"]},{"id":"2208566c28753d00","term":"오랜만","zh":"好久，久违","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3","entryId":"68090","definition":"从有某事开始过了很长时间后。","pronunciation":["오랜만"]},{"id":"71ab7f4d89daedab","term":"즐겁다","zh":"愉快，欢乐，欢快","audio":"/audio/71ab7f4d89daedabda61.mp3","entryId":"62101","definition":"内心满意、满足且快乐。","pronunciation":["즐겁따"]}],"audio":"/audio/21263a31949c9bbd8358.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.748,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66576","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":81,"sequenceScore":2.2281,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你和朋友见面还顺利吗？","嗯。因为突然接到他们的电话，本来没打算出门，但难得见了一次面，玩得很开心。","你哥哥又去哪儿了？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你和朋友见面得还顺利吗？","嗯。突然接到联系，虽然这次出门不在计划内，但难得玩得这么开心。","你哥哥又去哪儿了？"],"answer":1}]}
